    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Modify\r\n\r\nModify the Boba Run Splitter so it:\r\n\r\n* asks for the total cost of toppings\r\n* includes toppings in the subtotal\r\n* uses `round()` to convert the total into cents\r\n* uses `%` to find the cents part of the group total\r\n* prints the group total before the split amount\r\n\r\nTest your program to make sure the new input changes the total.\r\n",
